# RVM writes a timestamped backup whenever `rvm --ruby-version use` runs
.ruby-version.*

# Claude Code
#
# Shared config is checked in — CLAUDE.md, .claude/settings.json, and
# .claude/skills/ (the design system rules). Anything per-machine is not.
.claude/*.local.*
.claude/local/

# VS Code
